ation rule for the resumption seam (must be the point BOTH MCP and library closes traverse, not CLI-only) so the executor's seam choice is verifiable against AC #6, not open-ended.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5b","T5e","T6","T9"],"criteria":["E2"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.4114,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["'Executor confirms the exact seam (candidates: the gate_dispatch step that close_precheck's verdict inspection consumes) before coding, and records it in a ticket comment.'","The plan defines the seam behaviorally ('code that invokes verify_completion and inspects its verdict') but leaves the exact file/function as a candidate list to resolve."],"finding":"AC #1 defers the exact resumption seam to executor investigation ('Executor confirms the exact seam (candidates: the gate_dispatch step...) before coding').","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fe6819089ff3b98a5","impact":0.44,"is_primary":null,"location":"Mechanism bullet 1 / AC #6","norm_id":"n0fbd3391eba143d5","priority":0.1886,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Executor picks a seam that is CLI-adjacent rather than the shared dispatch, silently failing AC #6's 'MCP-or-library-path' requirement."],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Add: 'The seam is the single call site through which CLI, MCP, and library closes all reach verify_completion; if a candidate is not shared by all three paths it is disqualified.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity