etion was invoked) but a real resumption re-spends its whole budget and re-exhausts, so the auto-resume never actually closes.","The new default path (auto-resume) is validated only offline; the risky behavior it depends on (cache seeding + budget concentration) never runs end-to-end in a proving command."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Add AC: 'An end-to-end/fixture test seeds the verdict cache with per-criterion PASSes from an exhausted first attempt, triggers auto-resume, and asserts the resumption reports credited-from-cache count > 0 and reaches overall PASS.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Record the rationale for auto_resume_max default = 2 (e.g. one retry margin above the observed n=1 convergence) so the bound is a justified choice, not an unvalidated constant.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5a","T5b","T5e","T6","T9"],"criteria":["T2"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.6672,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["'verify.auto_resume_max resumptions per close invocation, default 2